[
  {
    "text": "Hello. Hello everyone.",
    "start": 0.0,
    "duration": 6.64
  },
  {
    "text": "Good to see the chat messages streaming",
    "start": 3.52,
    "duration": 5.119
  },
  {
    "text": "in",
    "start": 6.64,
    "duration": 4.48
  },
  {
    "text": "getting a sense of uh being together",
    "start": 8.639,
    "duration": 4.481
  },
  {
    "text": "here again",
    "start": 11.12,
    "duration": 6.439
  },
  {
    "text": "uh for me on a Wednesday morning",
    "start": 13.12,
    "duration": 4.439
  },
  {
    "text": "here in quite a sunny California here.",
    "start": 21.68,
    "duration": 8.759
  },
  {
    "text": "So, welcome everyone.",
    "start": 26.72,
    "duration": 3.719
  },
  {
    "text": "So this week uh we've been practicing",
    "start": 31.359,
    "duration": 6.88
  },
  {
    "text": "with this simile called crossing the",
    "start": 34.48,
    "duration": 5.759
  },
  {
    "text": "flood.",
    "start": 38.239,
    "duration": 7.201
  },
  {
    "text": "Um in the last couple of days um in our",
    "start": 40.239,
    "duration": 6.961
  },
  {
    "text": "meditation",
    "start": 45.44,
    "duration": 5.92
  },
  {
    "text": "we started with this metaphor of",
    "start": 47.2,
    "duration": 8.56
  },
  {
    "text": "stepping into the flow of our lives",
    "start": 51.36,
    "duration": 7.44
  },
  {
    "text": "and kind of moments moments of our lives",
    "start": 55.76,
    "duration": 6.24
  },
  {
    "text": "that forms of a flow.",
    "start": 58.8,
    "duration": 7.04
  },
  {
    "text": "And then uh yesterday uh we shared a",
    "start": 62.0,
    "duration": 6.479
  },
  {
    "text": "little reflection about",
    "start": 65.84,
    "duration": 7.44
  },
  {
    "text": "crossing. Crossing requires us to really",
    "start": 68.479,
    "duration": 11.201
  },
  {
    "text": "be in the current in the flow. And so we",
    "start": 73.28,
    "duration": 8.24
  },
  {
    "text": "uh did",
    "start": 79.68,
    "duration": 6.32
  },
  {
    "text": "not just stepping into the flow but also",
    "start": 81.52,
    "duration": 7.52
  },
  {
    "text": "uh staying in the flow.",
    "start": 86.0,
    "duration": 6.64
  },
  {
    "text": "Now today we're going to expand a little",
    "start": 89.04,
    "duration": 7.2
  },
  {
    "text": "more in that uh process",
    "start": 92.64,
    "duration": 8.56
  },
  {
    "text": "which is to stabilize ourselves in the",
    "start": 96.24,
    "duration": 6.48
  },
  {
    "text": "current",
    "start": 101.2,
    "duration": 5.12
  },
  {
    "text": "whether there may be waves,",
    "start": 102.72,
    "duration": 7.84
  },
  {
    "text": "larger amount of water or small streams.",
    "start": 106.32,
    "duration": 9.04
  },
  {
    "text": "We're learning to stabilize ourselves.",
    "start": 110.56,
    "duration": 7.76
  },
  {
    "text": "And so in this meditation,",
    "start": 115.36,
    "duration": 6.64
  },
  {
    "text": "we'll continue with this water flowing",
    "start": 118.32,
    "duration": 5.68
  },
  {
    "text": "metaphor",
    "start": 122.0,
    "duration": 6.319
  },
  {
    "text": "uh by stepping into the flow of our of",
    "start": 124.0,
    "duration": 6.399
  },
  {
    "text": "our moments",
    "start": 128.319,
    "duration": 6.081
  },
  {
    "text": "and then staying there and learning to",
    "start": 130.399,
    "duration": 6.881
  },
  {
    "text": "become stabilized",
    "start": 134.4,
    "duration": 5.52
  },
  {
    "text": "in the flow.",
    "start": 137.28,
    "duration": 7.4
  },
  {
    "text": "So let's meditate together.",
    "start": 139.92,
    "duration": 4.76
  },
  {
    "text": "Maybe taking a few long deep breaths.",
    "start": 148.8,
    "duration": 8.84
  },
  {
    "text": "Maybe three to be exact.",
    "start": 152.879,
    "duration": 4.761
  },
  {
    "text": "Breathing in deeply.",
    "start": 158.56,
    "duration": 5.0
  },
  {
    "text": "Breathing out",
    "start": 165.76,
    "duration": 3.64
  },
  {
    "text": "fully.",
    "start": 169.519,
    "duration": 3.0
  },
  {
    "text": "again.",
    "start": 177.12,
    "duration": 3.0
  },
  {
    "text": "And the third time.",
    "start": 185.04,
    "duration": 4.04
  },
  {
    "text": "And as you breathe out,",
    "start": 192.959,
    "duration": 6.161
  },
  {
    "text": "settle",
    "start": 196.959,
    "duration": 5.441
  },
  {
    "text": "into the space you're in",
    "start": 199.12,
    "duration": 6.08
  },
  {
    "text": "right here,",
    "start": 202.4,
    "duration": 6.119
  },
  {
    "text": "right now.",
    "start": 205.2,
    "duration": 3.319
  },
  {
    "text": "Stepping into",
    "start": 214.959,
    "duration": 6.84
  },
  {
    "text": "the present moment.",
    "start": 218.08,
    "duration": 3.719
  },
  {
    "text": "Stepping into sati",
    "start": 229.76,
    "duration": 6.839
  },
  {
    "text": "mindfulness.",
    "start": 233.599,
    "duration": 3.0
  },
  {
    "text": "There is a felt sense of",
    "start": 242.48,
    "duration": 6.839
  },
  {
    "text": "nowness.",
    "start": 246.319,
    "duration": 3.0
  },
  {
    "text": "Now this moment",
    "start": 250.319,
    "duration": 7.801
  },
  {
    "text": "it feels like this",
    "start": 254.0,
    "duration": 4.12
  },
  {
    "text": "at this moment.",
    "start": 263.759,
    "duration": 3.641
  },
  {
    "text": "And this moment",
    "start": 273.28,
    "duration": 3.72
  },
  {
    "text": "I can begin to notice the shift and",
    "start": 286.0,
    "duration": 8.12
  },
  {
    "text": "changes that happen in the body.",
    "start": 288.8,
    "duration": 5.32
  },
  {
    "text": "A kind of a gathering of energy,",
    "start": 294.96,
    "duration": 5.0
  },
  {
    "text": "settling",
    "start": 303.68,
    "duration": 5.359
  },
  {
    "text": "of the energy.",
    "start": 305.52,
    "duration": 6.239
  },
  {
    "text": "It's like the weight",
    "start": 309.039,
    "duration": 6.361
  },
  {
    "text": "settles down.",
    "start": 311.759,
    "duration": 3.641
  },
  {
    "text": "Mindfulness sati",
    "start": 326.4,
    "duration": 4.359
  },
  {
    "text": "can become fuller,",
    "start": 331.6,
    "duration": 6.52
  },
  {
    "text": "more expansive.",
    "start": 334.639,
    "duration": 3.481
  },
  {
    "text": "You're more",
    "start": 350.0,
    "duration": 6.639
  },
  {
    "text": "staying with the here",
    "start": 352.16,
    "duration": 7.84
  },
  {
    "text": "rather than going to",
    "start": 356.639,
    "duration": 7.721
  },
  {
    "text": "the objects in the mind.",
    "start": 360.0,
    "duration": 4.36
  },
  {
    "text": "resting.",
    "start": 376.8,
    "duration": 6.839
  },
  {
    "text": "Resting in the mindfulness,",
    "start": 379.28,
    "duration": 4.359
  },
  {
    "text": "things come alive",
    "start": 389.039,
    "duration": 7.241
  },
  {
    "text": "in the field of mindfulness.",
    "start": 391.759,
    "duration": 4.521
  },
  {
    "text": "Maybe there is a felt sense of being",
    "start": 412.16,
    "duration": 6.68
  },
  {
    "text": "available",
    "start": 415.84,
    "duration": 3.0
  },
  {
    "text": "to the embodied sensations",
    "start": 419.52,
    "duration": 4.679
  },
  {
    "text": "movements in the minds.",
    "start": 427.36,
    "duration": 3.959
  },
  {
    "text": "We are not in a hurry.",
    "start": 444.72,
    "duration": 5.4
  },
  {
    "text": "We're learning to steady ourselves",
    "start": 454.479,
    "duration": 6.041
  },
  {
    "text": "in the here",
    "start": 462.8,
    "duration": 5.0
  },
  {
    "text": "and now.",
    "start": 465.52,
    "duration": 6.239
  },
  {
    "text": "[Music]",
    "start": 467.8,
    "duration": 3.959
  },
  {
    "text": "There he is. And",
    "start": 478.879,
    "duration": 5.44
  },
  {
    "text": "energetic",
    "start": 481.52,
    "duration": 5.359
  },
  {
    "text": "participation",
    "start": 484.319,
    "duration": 8.28
  },
  {
    "text": "of the flow of life moments.",
    "start": 486.879,
    "duration": 5.72
  },
  {
    "text": "And we're not in a hurry.",
    "start": 496.4,
    "duration": 4.44
  },
  {
    "text": "What's the felt sense for you?",
    "start": 534.16,
    "duration": 7.72
  },
  {
    "text": "Not being in a hurry.",
    "start": 537.44,
    "duration": 4.44
  },
  {
    "text": "There may be ease in the body,",
    "start": 550.88,
    "duration": 5.079
  },
  {
    "text": "relaxation",
    "start": 558.399,
    "duration": 5.961
  },
  {
    "text": "in the heart.",
    "start": 560.88,
    "duration": 3.48
  },
  {
    "text": "And the mind may be more soft.",
    "start": 570.399,
    "duration": 4.841
  },
  {
    "text": "Fully immersed in this moment.",
    "start": 606.64,
    "duration": 5.8
  },
  {
    "text": "There can be a liveness.",
    "start": 619.76,
    "duration": 4.12
  },
  {
    "text": "And so there is no",
    "start": 636.0,
    "duration": 6.279
  },
  {
    "text": "complacency.",
    "start": 639.279,
    "duration": 3.0
  },
  {
    "text": "Maybe even a hint of delight",
    "start": 650.079,
    "duration": 6.121
  },
  {
    "text": "to be unhurried,",
    "start": 660.399,
    "duration": 3.721
  },
  {
    "text": "steady.",
    "start": 668.72,
    "duration": 3.0
  },
  {
    "text": "Stable",
    "start": 672.56,
    "duration": 3.0
  },
  {
    "text": "in the open",
    "start": 678.64,
    "duration": 5.72
  },
  {
    "text": "presence.",
    "start": 681.36,
    "duration": 3.0
  },
  {
    "text": "If there are any degrees of a wholesome",
    "start": 837.199,
    "duration": 8.361
  },
  {
    "text": "feelings present,",
    "start": 841.6,
    "duration": 3.96
  },
  {
    "text": "register it.",
    "start": 846.8,
    "duration": 3.719
  },
  {
    "text": "The stability,",
    "start": 857.839,
    "duration": 3.401
  },
  {
    "text": "steadiness",
    "start": 861.279,
    "duration": 3.0
  },
  {
    "text": "is calming for the nerve systems",
    "start": 864.56,
    "duration": 5.56
  },
  {
    "text": "and maybe there is a slight uplift",
    "start": 875.279,
    "duration": 6.92
  },
  {
    "text": "in the heart.",
    "start": 878.639,
    "duration": 3.56
  },
  {
    "text": "The delight",
    "start": 889.12,
    "duration": 6.76
  },
  {
    "text": "of walking the path.",
    "start": 891.36,
    "duration": 4.52
  },
  {
    "text": "I'm hurrying",
    "start": 916.72,
    "duration": 3.239
  },
  {
    "text": "on carrying",
    "start": 920.959,
    "duration": 3.721
  },
  {
    "text": "centered. All right.",
    "start": 936.32,
    "duration": 3.48
  },
  {
    "text": "There may be quiet joy here",
    "start": 971.92,
    "duration": 5.159
  },
  {
    "text": "in the stability.",
    "start": 978.639,
    "duration": 3.56
  },
  {
    "text": "And of course",
    "start": 1299.039,
    "duration": 6.161
  },
  {
    "text": "in the steadiness",
    "start": 1302.32,
    "duration": 6.08
  },
  {
    "text": "our mind can slip out",
    "start": 1305.2,
    "duration": 7.56
  },
  {
    "text": "into the past and future.",
    "start": 1308.4,
    "duration": 4.36
  },
  {
    "text": "narratives,",
    "start": 1313.6,
    "duration": 5.24
  },
  {
    "text": "stories.",
    "start": 1315.84,
    "duration": 3.0
  },
  {
    "text": "It's not a mistake.",
    "start": 1322.4,
    "duration": 3.88
  },
  {
    "text": "It's just what it is.",
    "start": 1326.88,
    "duration": 4.279
  },
  {
    "text": "When you notice it",
    "start": 1331.44,
    "duration": 8.239
  },
  {
    "text": "right here, right now,",
    "start": 1335.44,
    "duration": 7.76
  },
  {
    "text": "there is a choice",
    "start": 1339.679,
    "duration": 6.48
  },
  {
    "text": "to come back",
    "start": 1343.2,
    "duration": 6.8
  },
  {
    "text": "to the present moment,",
    "start": 1346.159,
    "duration": 6.801
  },
  {
    "text": "mindful",
    "start": 1350.0,
    "duration": 6.36
  },
  {
    "text": "and aware.",
    "start": 1352.96,
    "duration": 3.4
  },
  {
    "text": "without the second arrow.",
    "start": 1359.039,
    "duration": 4.441
  },
  {
    "text": "Just now.",
    "start": 1368.72,
    "duration": 3.24
  },
  {
    "text": "Just now.",
    "start": 1376.08,
    "duration": 3.24
  },
  {
    "text": "You don't need to count",
    "start": 1399.6,
    "duration": 8.12
  },
  {
    "text": "how many times you come back",
    "start": 1402.88,
    "duration": 4.84
  },
  {
    "text": "to this moment.",
    "start": 1407.919,
    "duration": 3.64
  },
  {
    "text": "What matters",
    "start": 1412.72,
    "duration": 3.4
  },
  {
    "text": "is this moment.",
    "start": 1416.88,
    "duration": 3.72
  },
  {
    "text": "You come back to this moment.",
    "start": 1424.799,
    "duration": 4.681
  },
  {
    "text": "That's enough.",
    "start": 1431.44,
    "duration": 3.32
  },
  {
    "text": "in the steadiness",
    "start": 1768.64,
    "duration": 3.96
  },
  {
    "text": "and the stability of your presence.",
    "start": 1773.84,
    "duration": 5.64
  },
  {
    "text": "might you meet life",
    "start": 1781.76,
    "duration": 4.039
  },
  {
    "text": "in a new way?",
    "start": 1786.159,
    "duration": 3.961
  },
  {
    "text": "What becomes available",
    "start": 1791.679,
    "duration": 7.521
  },
  {
    "text": "in this steadiness",
    "start": 1795.6,
    "duration": 7.079
  },
  {
    "text": "and a stability.",
    "start": 1799.2,
    "duration": 3.479
  },
  {
    "text": "Maybe the felt sense in the body",
    "start": 1811.44,
    "duration": 7.479
  },
  {
    "text": "expresses",
    "start": 1815.919,
    "duration": 3.0
  },
  {
    "text": "a kind of goodness.",
    "start": 1818.96,
    "duration": 5.959
  },
  {
    "text": "well-being",
    "start": 1821.919,
    "duration": 3.0
  },
  {
    "text": "in the midst of non well-being.",
    "start": 1826.0,
    "duration": 5.24
  },
  {
    "text": "Might that be a possibility",
    "start": 1832.24,
    "duration": 4.439
  },
  {
    "text": "for you, for us,",
    "start": 1837.919,
    "duration": 9.48
  },
  {
    "text": "and for the people we encounter?",
    "start": 1842.48,
    "duration": 4.919
  },
  {
    "text": "[Music]",
    "start": 1852.24,
    "duration": 12.449
  },
  {
    "text": "So in crossing the flood",
    "start": 1883.039,
    "duration": 4.081
  },
  {
    "text": "There's a simile and that whipping",
    "start": 1888.24,
    "duration": 4.72
  },
  {
    "text": "unfolding.",
    "start": 1890.559,
    "duration": 7.761
  },
  {
    "text": "Um we spoke about the symbolic meanings",
    "start": 1892.96,
    "duration": 9.36
  },
  {
    "text": "of flood, greed, hatred, delusion, the",
    "start": 1898.32,
    "duration": 7.599
  },
  {
    "text": "forces, unh wholesome forces that uh",
    "start": 1902.32,
    "duration": 7.359
  },
  {
    "text": "tend to overwhelm us.",
    "start": 1905.919,
    "duration": 7.76
  },
  {
    "text": "And uh we spoke about crossing.",
    "start": 1909.679,
    "duration": 8.0
  },
  {
    "text": "Not so obvious, you know. Um but the",
    "start": 1913.679,
    "duration": 8.48
  },
  {
    "text": "Buddha said, \"I crossed the flood.\"",
    "start": 1917.679,
    "duration": 7.441
  },
  {
    "text": "And so the deity who asked the question",
    "start": 1922.159,
    "duration": 7.281
  },
  {
    "text": "got really curious. And so um the deity",
    "start": 1925.12,
    "duration": 6.559
  },
  {
    "text": "asked the Buddha, \"How did you do that?",
    "start": 1929.44,
    "duration": 7.119
  },
  {
    "text": "How did you cross the flood?\" Here is a",
    "start": 1931.679,
    "duration": 8.88
  },
  {
    "text": "rather cryptic answer.",
    "start": 1936.559,
    "duration": 10.081
  },
  {
    "text": "So the Buddha said, \"By not halting,",
    "start": 1940.559,
    "duration": 8.081
  },
  {
    "text": "not straining,",
    "start": 1946.64,
    "duration": 5.879
  },
  {
    "text": "I cross the flood.\"",
    "start": 1948.64,
    "duration": 3.879
  },
  {
    "text": "Not halting,",
    "start": 1952.96,
    "duration": 3.92
  },
  {
    "text": "not straining,",
    "start": 1954.799,
    "duration": 5.441
  },
  {
    "text": "I cross the flood.",
    "start": 1956.88,
    "duration": 6.88
  },
  {
    "text": "And there are um often other words when",
    "start": 1960.24,
    "duration": 6.72
  },
  {
    "text": "uh teachers uh share their expressions",
    "start": 1963.76,
    "duration": 6.48
  },
  {
    "text": "of this. And in the meditation I also",
    "start": 1966.96,
    "duration": 4.8
  },
  {
    "text": "used",
    "start": 1970.24,
    "duration": 3.679
  },
  {
    "text": "not carrying",
    "start": 1971.76,
    "duration": 5.12
  },
  {
    "text": "and this a sense of",
    "start": 1973.919,
    "duration": 6.88
  },
  {
    "text": "freezing and not hurrying",
    "start": 1976.88,
    "duration": 6.32
  },
  {
    "text": "not get busy",
    "start": 1980.799,
    "duration": 6.641
  },
  {
    "text": "engaging in or over stimulation",
    "start": 1983.2,
    "duration": 7.76
  },
  {
    "text": "or sometimes um teacher might might also",
    "start": 1987.44,
    "duration": 8.4
  },
  {
    "text": "use not overexerting",
    "start": 1990.96,
    "duration": 9.719
  },
  {
    "text": "or under efforting,",
    "start": 1995.84,
    "duration": 4.839
  },
  {
    "text": "not",
    "start": 2001.279,
    "duration": 3.361
  },
  {
    "text": "um",
    "start": 2003.039,
    "duration": 4.961
  },
  {
    "text": "um being complacent,",
    "start": 2004.64,
    "duration": 7.519
  },
  {
    "text": "but not being overly stimulated.",
    "start": 2008.0,
    "duration": 7.12
  },
  {
    "text": "I'm using all of the words to kind of",
    "start": 2012.159,
    "duration": 8.481
  },
  {
    "text": "point to that the Buddha is pointing to",
    "start": 2015.12,
    "duration": 9.439
  },
  {
    "text": "um the common phenomenons when we're",
    "start": 2020.64,
    "duration": 6.0
  },
  {
    "text": "stepping into the water, you know,",
    "start": 2024.559,
    "duration": 4.561
  },
  {
    "text": "stepping into the flow.",
    "start": 2026.64,
    "duration": 5.6
  },
  {
    "text": "uh what tend to happen",
    "start": 2029.12,
    "duration": 8.48
  },
  {
    "text": "and uh inviting us uh a different way to",
    "start": 2032.24,
    "duration": 9.2
  },
  {
    "text": "go through this to go through this uh uh",
    "start": 2037.6,
    "duration": 7.84
  },
  {
    "text": "kind of choppy water so to speak at",
    "start": 2041.44,
    "duration": 8.639
  },
  {
    "text": "times. I remember uh being in a choppy",
    "start": 2045.44,
    "duration": 7.919
  },
  {
    "text": "water kind of swimming in the ocean once",
    "start": 2050.079,
    "duration": 7.441
  },
  {
    "text": "and uh there was uh some moments that",
    "start": 2053.359,
    "duration": 7.841
  },
  {
    "text": "the waves got a little bigger and uh I",
    "start": 2057.52,
    "duration": 7.359
  },
  {
    "text": "was not so far into uh the ocean but it",
    "start": 2061.2,
    "duration": 6.32
  },
  {
    "text": "was still close to the shore but it was",
    "start": 2064.879,
    "duration": 7.441
  },
  {
    "text": "far enough and that when the waves came",
    "start": 2067.52,
    "duration": 8.0
  },
  {
    "text": "I got panicky. I start kind of swim",
    "start": 2072.32,
    "duration": 4.72
  },
  {
    "text": "fearlessly",
    "start": 2075.52,
    "duration": 5.119
  },
  {
    "text": "but very quickly within seconds",
    "start": 2077.04,
    "duration": 7.52
  },
  {
    "text": "I know I started exhausting myself",
    "start": 2080.639,
    "duration": 6.321
  },
  {
    "text": "and I wasn't so close to the shore that",
    "start": 2084.56,
    "duration": 5.68
  },
  {
    "text": "if I kept on doing this I will not make",
    "start": 2086.96,
    "duration": 5.919
  },
  {
    "text": "it to the shore",
    "start": 2090.24,
    "duration": 6.399
  },
  {
    "text": "and so I had to slow down to just be",
    "start": 2092.879,
    "duration": 8.24
  },
  {
    "text": "steady in my strokes to move towards the",
    "start": 2096.639,
    "duration": 6.641
  },
  {
    "text": "shore.",
    "start": 2101.119,
    "duration": 2.161
  },
  {
    "text": "And so there's a sense of um",
    "start": 2105.119,
    "duration": 6.561
  },
  {
    "text": "hurrying",
    "start": 2109.76,
    "duration": 3.76
  },
  {
    "text": "or straining",
    "start": 2111.68,
    "duration": 5.28
  },
  {
    "text": "and we often have an we we may often",
    "start": 2113.52,
    "duration": 6.72
  },
  {
    "text": "notice that we're in a hurrying culture.",
    "start": 2116.96,
    "duration": 6.0
  },
  {
    "text": "You know, we're quite in a hurry. We're",
    "start": 2120.24,
    "duration": 6.879
  },
  {
    "text": "always in a rush often and rushing from",
    "start": 2122.96,
    "duration": 6.639
  },
  {
    "text": "one appointment to another, one meeting",
    "start": 2127.119,
    "duration": 7.441
  },
  {
    "text": "to another or uh one thing to another. I",
    "start": 2129.599,
    "duration": 7.601
  },
  {
    "text": "remember when I worked and that was a",
    "start": 2134.56,
    "duration": 6.08
  },
  {
    "text": "time that uh you know I was running",
    "start": 2137.2,
    "duration": 6.24
  },
  {
    "text": "literally running from one meeting to",
    "start": 2140.64,
    "duration": 8.24
  },
  {
    "text": "another. I wouldn't notice that um I",
    "start": 2143.44,
    "duration": 8.0
  },
  {
    "text": "wouldn't have my whole foot on the",
    "start": 2148.88,
    "duration": 5.28
  },
  {
    "text": "ground before I kind of take the next",
    "start": 2151.44,
    "duration": 5.12
  },
  {
    "text": "step. So, it's almost like a tipping my",
    "start": 2154.16,
    "duration": 5.28
  },
  {
    "text": "toe forward, tipping my body forward to",
    "start": 2156.56,
    "duration": 7.16
  },
  {
    "text": "go lean forward",
    "start": 2159.44,
    "duration": 4.28
  },
  {
    "text": "and that's easy to fall, right? That's",
    "start": 2164.0,
    "duration": 7.28
  },
  {
    "text": "easy to fall. So in this practice,",
    "start": 2166.8,
    "duration": 8.559
  },
  {
    "text": "the Buddha said we're not in a hurry,",
    "start": 2171.28,
    "duration": 7.559
  },
  {
    "text": "not hurrying.",
    "start": 2175.359,
    "duration": 3.48
  },
  {
    "text": "And we can be uh in a big hurry to want",
    "start": 2179.839,
    "duration": 7.081
  },
  {
    "text": "what we wanted.",
    "start": 2183.359,
    "duration": 3.561
  },
  {
    "text": "Maybe it's this outcome orientation,",
    "start": 2187.119,
    "duration": 5.281
  },
  {
    "text": "result orientation.",
    "start": 2190.0,
    "duration": 6.24
  },
  {
    "text": "And even in meditation we can get kind",
    "start": 2192.4,
    "duration": 7.12
  },
  {
    "text": "of spiritual ambitions. You know if I'm",
    "start": 2196.24,
    "duration": 7.44
  },
  {
    "text": "not calm within the first 10 minutes",
    "start": 2199.52,
    "duration": 7.2
  },
  {
    "text": "somehow I'm not doing it right",
    "start": 2203.68,
    "duration": 6.88
  },
  {
    "text": "or you know I should be quitting doing",
    "start": 2206.72,
    "duration": 6.48
  },
  {
    "text": "it all together. And so this kind of a",
    "start": 2210.56,
    "duration": 6.4
  },
  {
    "text": "striving overeing",
    "start": 2213.2,
    "duration": 8.68
  },
  {
    "text": "and this actually hinders us",
    "start": 2216.96,
    "duration": 4.92
  },
  {
    "text": "and it does not cultivate this kind of a",
    "start": 2222.0,
    "duration": 8.88
  },
  {
    "text": "capacity that the Buddha is pointing to",
    "start": 2225.119,
    "duration": 9.841
  },
  {
    "text": "this capacity of being steady with our",
    "start": 2230.88,
    "duration": 7.08
  },
  {
    "text": "experience.",
    "start": 2234.96,
    "duration": 3.0
  },
  {
    "text": "And then um there's a sense of not",
    "start": 2238.8,
    "duration": 6.16
  },
  {
    "text": "halting,",
    "start": 2243.359,
    "duration": 4.48
  },
  {
    "text": "not tearing",
    "start": 2244.96,
    "duration": 5.76
  },
  {
    "text": "um that may manifest in many different",
    "start": 2247.839,
    "duration": 5.121
  },
  {
    "text": "ways for us.",
    "start": 2250.72,
    "duration": 5.119
  },
  {
    "text": "um halting",
    "start": 2252.96,
    "duration": 5.76
  },
  {
    "text": "uh carrying. Sometimes it may manifest",
    "start": 2255.839,
    "duration": 6.24
  },
  {
    "text": "as a kind of complacency,",
    "start": 2258.72,
    "duration": 6.32
  },
  {
    "text": "lethargic,",
    "start": 2262.079,
    "duration": 6.561
  },
  {
    "text": "not halting in going through the",
    "start": 2265.04,
    "duration": 6.88
  },
  {
    "text": "current. There is actually a kind of",
    "start": 2268.64,
    "duration": 5.84
  },
  {
    "text": "alive engagement.",
    "start": 2271.92,
    "duration": 8.4
  },
  {
    "text": "You feel energetic engagement with life.",
    "start": 2274.48,
    "duration": 10.72
  },
  {
    "text": "There is a kind of soft vigilance",
    "start": 2280.32,
    "duration": 8.0
  },
  {
    "text": "but it's not a freezing either",
    "start": 2285.2,
    "duration": 6.0
  },
  {
    "text": "you know so if we're freezing in the",
    "start": 2288.32,
    "duration": 5.2
  },
  {
    "text": "current and guess what it won't help",
    "start": 2291.2,
    "duration": 6.24
  },
  {
    "text": "right it won't help crossing the flood",
    "start": 2293.52,
    "duration": 6.64
  },
  {
    "text": "and there are many manifestations of",
    "start": 2297.44,
    "duration": 6.56
  },
  {
    "text": "this kind of a freezing also sometimes",
    "start": 2300.16,
    "duration": 8.08
  },
  {
    "text": "uh it can be a physical kind of froze",
    "start": 2304.0,
    "duration": 8.16
  },
  {
    "text": "you know froze because of anger uh in",
    "start": 2308.24,
    "duration": 7.04
  },
  {
    "text": "the body. It can also be psychological",
    "start": 2312.16,
    "duration": 5.84
  },
  {
    "text": "or emotional",
    "start": 2315.28,
    "duration": 5.92
  },
  {
    "text": "that we can have a kind of sinking a",
    "start": 2318.0,
    "duration": 6.0
  },
  {
    "text": "stuck feeling",
    "start": 2321.2,
    "duration": 5.44
  },
  {
    "text": "and we're not quite present for our",
    "start": 2324.0,
    "duration": 4.72
  },
  {
    "text": "experience.",
    "start": 2326.64,
    "duration": 7.4
  },
  {
    "text": "It may be spacey, you know, spaced out.",
    "start": 2328.72,
    "duration": 5.32
  },
  {
    "text": "And um and so those are the things for",
    "start": 2334.48,
    "duration": 7.44
  },
  {
    "text": "us to begin to notice. Um",
    "start": 2337.76,
    "duration": 7.28
  },
  {
    "text": "what is the manifestations of this? What",
    "start": 2341.92,
    "duration": 7.28
  },
  {
    "text": "does it feel like to not halting, not",
    "start": 2345.04,
    "duration": 6.0
  },
  {
    "text": "hurrying?",
    "start": 2349.2,
    "duration": 4.8
  },
  {
    "text": "Another kind of a halting",
    "start": 2351.04,
    "duration": 6.16
  },
  {
    "text": "um is when we're stuck in some kind of a",
    "start": 2354.0,
    "duration": 8.16
  },
  {
    "text": "fixations in our ideas and views.",
    "start": 2357.2,
    "duration": 9.6
  },
  {
    "text": "If we are identified or defined by our",
    "start": 2362.16,
    "duration": 8.64
  },
  {
    "text": "patterns of or the waves of emotions,",
    "start": 2366.8,
    "duration": 7.279
  },
  {
    "text": "fear or anger or whatever others that",
    "start": 2370.8,
    "duration": 5.52
  },
  {
    "text": "might be here",
    "start": 2374.079,
    "duration": 5.04
  },
  {
    "text": "and we can freeze ourselves into a kind",
    "start": 2376.32,
    "duration": 5.039
  },
  {
    "text": "of a belief",
    "start": 2379.119,
    "duration": 4.72
  },
  {
    "text": "this is who I am.",
    "start": 2381.359,
    "duration": 6.961
  },
  {
    "text": "we can't me move beyond it and uh all",
    "start": 2383.839,
    "duration": 6.881
  },
  {
    "text": "that uh we're relating to the",
    "start": 2388.32,
    "duration": 5.12
  },
  {
    "text": "experiences can now begin to through",
    "start": 2390.72,
    "duration": 4.639
  },
  {
    "text": "that lens",
    "start": 2393.44,
    "duration": 4.8
  },
  {
    "text": "that lens of this is who I am I can't",
    "start": 2395.359,
    "duration": 7.441
  },
  {
    "text": "I'm always agitated I'm always anxious",
    "start": 2398.24,
    "duration": 8.0
  },
  {
    "text": "so we can't see the possibilities of",
    "start": 2402.8,
    "duration": 6.44
  },
  {
    "text": "momentary",
    "start": 2406.24,
    "duration": 3.0
  },
  {
    "text": "freedom from anxiety",
    "start": 2409.52,
    "duration": 6.48
  },
  {
    "text": "So this hurrying",
    "start": 2413.599,
    "duration": 6.24
  },
  {
    "text": "tearing have many manifestations",
    "start": 2416.0,
    "duration": 8.96
  },
  {
    "text": "and so is the unhurried mind untared",
    "start": 2419.839,
    "duration": 7.52
  },
  {
    "text": "mind.",
    "start": 2424.96,
    "duration": 6.72
  },
  {
    "text": "So the Buddha uses rather specific words",
    "start": 2427.359,
    "duration": 7.921
  },
  {
    "text": "but it's also pointing to a whole range",
    "start": 2431.68,
    "duration": 6.72
  },
  {
    "text": "and a whole territory. So they're not a",
    "start": 2435.28,
    "duration": 6.559
  },
  {
    "text": "fixed thing. They may they are very",
    "start": 2438.4,
    "duration": 6.08
  },
  {
    "text": "quite situational",
    "start": 2441.839,
    "duration": 6.801
  },
  {
    "text": "and so uh an important step uh in",
    "start": 2444.48,
    "duration": 8.4
  },
  {
    "text": "practicing towards this orientation of",
    "start": 2448.64,
    "duration": 9.199
  },
  {
    "text": "non hurrying non- tearing is to learn to",
    "start": 2452.88,
    "duration": 6.8
  },
  {
    "text": "recognize",
    "start": 2457.839,
    "duration": 6.641
  },
  {
    "text": "the subjective experiences of this",
    "start": 2459.68,
    "duration": 6.96
  },
  {
    "text": "the unhurried",
    "start": 2464.48,
    "duration": 5.68
  },
  {
    "text": "uncarried. How does it feel for me in",
    "start": 2466.64,
    "duration": 7.679
  },
  {
    "text": "this moment in this situation?",
    "start": 2470.16,
    "duration": 6.08
  },
  {
    "text": "You know, the Buddha didn't really say,",
    "start": 2474.319,
    "duration": 4.8
  },
  {
    "text": "you know, you always walk at 5 miles per",
    "start": 2476.24,
    "duration": 8.0
  },
  {
    "text": "hour or, you know, in the 65\u00b0 direction.",
    "start": 2479.119,
    "duration": 7.281
  },
  {
    "text": "No,",
    "start": 2484.24,
    "duration": 4.48
  },
  {
    "text": "there was a this is something that is",
    "start": 2486.4,
    "duration": 6.56
  },
  {
    "text": "rather alive for us to feel into in the",
    "start": 2488.72,
    "duration": 7.28
  },
  {
    "text": "different situations that we're in",
    "start": 2492.96,
    "duration": 5.6
  },
  {
    "text": "because the current the flow of our",
    "start": 2496.0,
    "duration": 4.96
  },
  {
    "text": "lives",
    "start": 2498.56,
    "duration": 5.519
  },
  {
    "text": "are ever shifting and changing. So what",
    "start": 2500.96,
    "duration": 8.0
  },
  {
    "text": "might be needed is quite different",
    "start": 2504.079,
    "duration": 8.24
  },
  {
    "text": "in the meditation. Sometimes",
    "start": 2508.96,
    "duration": 5.92
  },
  {
    "text": "maybe on retreat or maybe on long",
    "start": 2512.319,
    "duration": 5.121
  },
  {
    "text": "retreat",
    "start": 2514.88,
    "duration": 7.04
  },
  {
    "text": "um there are a very few or maybe there",
    "start": 2517.44,
    "duration": 8.96
  },
  {
    "text": "are smaller waves of wanting not wanting",
    "start": 2521.92,
    "duration": 9.199
  },
  {
    "text": "aversion. The flood streams are not so",
    "start": 2526.4,
    "duration": 7.719
  },
  {
    "text": "big",
    "start": 2531.119,
    "duration": 3.0
  },
  {
    "text": "and this crossing the flood can feel",
    "start": 2534.24,
    "duration": 6.0
  },
  {
    "text": "effortless. It's this kind of effortless",
    "start": 2536.96,
    "duration": 5.52
  },
  {
    "text": "effort.",
    "start": 2540.24,
    "duration": 4.879
  },
  {
    "text": "Not much to do.",
    "start": 2542.48,
    "duration": 5.04
  },
  {
    "text": "We're more learning to be present just",
    "start": 2545.119,
    "duration": 7.041
  },
  {
    "text": "as it is and that's enough.",
    "start": 2547.52,
    "duration": 8.28
  },
  {
    "text": "And other times",
    "start": 2552.16,
    "duration": 3.64
  },
  {
    "text": "can be on retreat, can be in daily life",
    "start": 2555.839,
    "duration": 6.161
  },
  {
    "text": "and there may be just streams of a",
    "start": 2559.76,
    "duration": 5.12
  },
  {
    "text": "fantasies and very juicy stories that",
    "start": 2562.0,
    "duration": 5.04
  },
  {
    "text": "takes away",
    "start": 2564.88,
    "duration": 4.64
  },
  {
    "text": "uh from the present moment.",
    "start": 2567.04,
    "duration": 6.16
  },
  {
    "text": "And so what might be needed for us to",
    "start": 2569.52,
    "duration": 7.839
  },
  {
    "text": "learn is to have a skillful way to allow",
    "start": 2573.2,
    "duration": 8.76
  },
  {
    "text": "us to come back to the present moment.",
    "start": 2577.359,
    "duration": 4.601
  },
  {
    "text": "That may be a little uh uplift in us to",
    "start": 2582.079,
    "duration": 7.52
  },
  {
    "text": "be present, more fully to be more",
    "start": 2586.0,
    "duration": 7.28
  },
  {
    "text": "embodied and again and again",
    "start": 2589.599,
    "duration": 8.161
  },
  {
    "text": "and also as best as we can. We're not",
    "start": 2593.28,
    "duration": 7.839
  },
  {
    "text": "pushing ourselves, demanding ourselves.",
    "start": 2597.76,
    "duration": 8.72
  },
  {
    "text": "And so our effort is a kind of in sync",
    "start": 2601.119,
    "duration": 9.441
  },
  {
    "text": "with uh a kind of a degree, some degrees",
    "start": 2606.48,
    "duration": 7.359
  },
  {
    "text": "of stability. We're not looking for",
    "start": 2610.56,
    "duration": 6.08
  },
  {
    "text": "perfect here.",
    "start": 2613.839,
    "duration": 7.121
  },
  {
    "text": "Um and sometimes uh when there are big",
    "start": 2616.64,
    "duration": 8.08
  },
  {
    "text": "eddies, big storms,",
    "start": 2620.96,
    "duration": 6.32
  },
  {
    "text": "what may be needed",
    "start": 2624.72,
    "duration": 6.0
  },
  {
    "text": "is to turn our attention away. Maybe we",
    "start": 2627.28,
    "duration": 7.839
  },
  {
    "text": "go walk in the nature, do some gardening",
    "start": 2630.72,
    "duration": 7.359
  },
  {
    "text": "or talking to some friends to get",
    "start": 2635.119,
    "duration": 5.96
  },
  {
    "text": "support.",
    "start": 2638.079,
    "duration": 3.0
  },
  {
    "text": "The Buddha didn't say that you can't",
    "start": 2641.92,
    "duration": 6.32
  },
  {
    "text": "walk with other companions on the path.",
    "start": 2644.56,
    "duration": 6.08
  },
  {
    "text": "In fact, you said walk with other",
    "start": 2648.24,
    "duration": 5.2
  },
  {
    "text": "companions on the path.",
    "start": 2650.64,
    "duration": 6.24
  },
  {
    "text": "So why do we limit ourselves? You know,",
    "start": 2653.44,
    "duration": 6.399
  },
  {
    "text": "our our ego mind sometimes can come up",
    "start": 2656.88,
    "duration": 4.479
  },
  {
    "text": "with",
    "start": 2659.839,
    "duration": 5.52
  },
  {
    "text": "um certain ideas and then lock ourselves",
    "start": 2661.359,
    "duration": 6.48
  },
  {
    "text": "into those ideas.",
    "start": 2665.359,
    "duration": 5.601
  },
  {
    "text": "It can get grandiose",
    "start": 2667.839,
    "duration": 6.161
  },
  {
    "text": "or resultdriven,",
    "start": 2670.96,
    "duration": 5.76
  },
  {
    "text": "demanding ourselves to go conquer the",
    "start": 2674.0,
    "duration": 6.319
  },
  {
    "text": "biggest waves in our lives right now.",
    "start": 2676.72,
    "duration": 5.68
  },
  {
    "text": "No,",
    "start": 2680.319,
    "duration": 7.961
  },
  {
    "text": "we're learning to cultivate a capacity.",
    "start": 2682.4,
    "duration": 5.88
  },
  {
    "text": "So the measure is not based on our ego's",
    "start": 2688.8,
    "duration": 6.799
  },
  {
    "text": "ambitions",
    "start": 2693.68,
    "duration": 5.76
  },
  {
    "text": "but it's based on the sincerity of the",
    "start": 2695.599,
    "duration": 6.24
  },
  {
    "text": "practice",
    "start": 2699.44,
    "duration": 5.76
  },
  {
    "text": "coming back here and now not some kind",
    "start": 2701.839,
    "duration": 8.041
  },
  {
    "text": "of outcome in the future.",
    "start": 2705.2,
    "duration": 4.68
  },
  {
    "text": "And so our effort is in some kind of",
    "start": 2710.079,
    "duration": 6.24
  },
  {
    "text": "proportion to what's available uh in our",
    "start": 2712.88,
    "duration": 5.04
  },
  {
    "text": "capacity.",
    "start": 2716.319,
    "duration": 4.641
  },
  {
    "text": "So we start small and we let ourselves",
    "start": 2717.92,
    "duration": 6.64
  },
  {
    "text": "be steady in the baby waves first and",
    "start": 2720.96,
    "duration": 6.879
  },
  {
    "text": "then we grow from there and then we",
    "start": 2724.56,
    "duration": 7.519
  },
  {
    "text": "learn from our experience",
    "start": 2727.839,
    "duration": 6.801
  },
  {
    "text": "and so this is uh something that we will",
    "start": 2732.079,
    "duration": 4.481
  },
  {
    "text": "continue",
    "start": 2734.64,
    "duration": 5.28
  },
  {
    "text": "and you see in the suta that the uh",
    "start": 2736.56,
    "duration": 5.68
  },
  {
    "text": "deity wasn't satisfied with this",
    "start": 2739.92,
    "duration": 5.6
  },
  {
    "text": "oneliner the Buddha offered",
    "start": 2742.24,
    "duration": 5.44
  },
  {
    "text": "and so we will explore and there there's",
    "start": 2745.52,
    "duration": 5.12
  },
  {
    "text": "some more that we can learn from our",
    "start": 2747.68,
    "duration": 5.52
  },
  {
    "text": "experience as well.",
    "start": 2750.64,
    "duration": 5.12
  },
  {
    "text": "So for today",
    "start": 2753.2,
    "duration": 6.8
  },
  {
    "text": "uh as you go about the day",
    "start": 2755.76,
    "duration": 5.76
  },
  {
    "text": "recognize",
    "start": 2760.0,
    "duration": 6.16
  },
  {
    "text": "uh the felt sense of hurrying, tearing",
    "start": 2761.52,
    "duration": 8.64
  },
  {
    "text": "and the absence of hurrying and tearing",
    "start": 2766.16,
    "duration": 7.439
  },
  {
    "text": "and be attuned to what the effect is for",
    "start": 2770.16,
    "duration": 5.679
  },
  {
    "text": "you.",
    "start": 2773.599,
    "duration": 5.041
  },
  {
    "text": "How does it affect me in my heart and",
    "start": 2775.839,
    "duration": 4.721
  },
  {
    "text": "mind?",
    "start": 2778.64,
    "duration": 4.88
  },
  {
    "text": "And we will continue tomorrow.",
    "start": 2780.56,
    "duration": 6.36
  },
  {
    "text": "Thank you everyone.",
    "start": 2783.52,
    "duration": 3.4
  },
  {
    "text": "Have a wonderful rest of the day.",
    "start": 2787.52,
    "duration": 4.839
  }
]